Multi-Model Serving Architecture (multi-model)
This project implements a multi-model serving platform for xFusionCorp Industries, routing requests across three independent Flask-based microservices (fraud, churn, and recommend) through a single centralized Nginx reverse proxy running on port 8085.

Architecture Overview
Plaintext
[ Client Request ] 
       │
       ▼ (Port 8085)
   [ Nginx Reverse Proxy ]
       ├── /fraud/     ──► [ Fraud Service (Port 5000) ]
       ├── /churn/     ──► [ Churn Service (Port 5000) ]
       └── /recommend/ ──► [ Recommend Service (Port 5000) ]
